<section class="relative pt-40 pb-20 container mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-zinc-900 border border-white/5 text-zinc-500 text-[10px] font-mono mb-6">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
                v3.0 // isanchez_vargas
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-bold mb-6 tracking-tighter text-white leading-tight">
                De la idea <br />
                al <span class="text-blue-500 underline decoration-blue-500/30 underline-offset-8">código</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-zinc-400 mb-10 max-w-lg leading-relaxed font-light">
                Soy Isac. Me dedico a construir software que resuelve problemas reales, desde sistemas para robótica hasta herramientas de accesibilidad. No me complico: <span class="text-zinc-200">código limpio y soluciones que escalan.</span>
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
                <a href="#projects" class="px-8 py-4 bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-500 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl shadow-blue-600/10">
                    Mis Proyectos
                </a>
                <a href="#contact" class="font-mono text-sm border-b border-zinc-800 hover:border-blue-500 transition-colors py-1">
                    Hablemos →
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Personal Signature / Code Snippet -->
        <div class="relative group hidden lg:block">
            <div class="relative bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-3xl overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10">
                    <svg class="w-32 h-32" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.041-1.416-4.041-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="font-mono text-xs space-y-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-zinc-800"></div>
                        <span class="text-zinc-600">// actual_status.py</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-1">
                        <p><span class="text-blue-500">class</span> <span class="text-emerald-400">Developer</span>:</p>
                        <p class="pl-4">name = <span class="text-orange-400">"Isac Sánchez Vargas"</span></p>
                        <p class="pl-4">focus = [<span class="text-orange-400">"Robotics"</span>, <span class="text-orange-400">"Back-end"</span>, <span class="text-orange-400">"Real-time"</span>]</p>
                        <p class="pl-4">motto = <span class="text-orange-400">"Transformando ideas en realidad digital."</span></p>
                        <p class="pl-4 text-zinc-500 pt-4"># Actualmente trabajando en:</p>
                        <p class="pl-4 text-zinc-300">"Optimizando sistemas de baja latencia para competencias FTC."</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-white/5 flex justify-between items-center">
                    <div class="flex gap-4">
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-widest">Python 3.12</span>
                        <span class="text-[10px] text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-widest">Astro 4.0</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-emerald-500 text-[10px] font-mono animate-pulse">● LIVE_SERVER</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
